WEBVTT

00:04:58.916 --> 00:05:00.676
that went into writing this book

00:05:00.716 --> 00:05:05.196
and how you ultimately found yourself

00:05:05.236 --> 00:05:09.196
in this place where bittersweet
was the end product?

00:05:09.716 --> 00:05:14.236
SC: As most of us do,
I come from a heritage of love and loss.

00:05:15.636 --> 00:05:18.436
In my case,

00:05:18.476 --> 00:05:22.196
most members of my family,
the previous generations,

00:05:22.236 --> 00:05:23.716
were killed in the Holocaust.

00:05:23.756 --> 00:05:26.116
On my mother's side and my father's side.

00:05:26.116 --> 00:05:30.836
You know, I explore in the book
the whole phenomenon of inherited grief,